(===== Settings - edit here =====)
(Feeds, mm/min)
#<t1_feed>=1200 (T1 1/4in flat end mill - cutting: 1200 mm/min = 20 mm/s)
#<t1_plunge>=240 (T1 1/4in flat end mill - plunging: 240 mm/min = 4 mm/s)
#<t2_feed>=1200 (T2 1/2in bull nose R3 - cutting: 1200 mm/min = 20 mm/s)
#<t2_plunge>=180 (T2 1/2in bull nose R3 - plunging: 180 mm/min = 3 mm/s)
#<t3_feed>=900 (T3 1/4in ball nose - cutting: 900 mm/min = 15 mm/s)
#<t3_plunge>=180 (T3 1/4in ball nose - plunging: 180 mm/min = 3 mm/s)
#<t4_feed>=900 (T4 60 deg V-bit 1/2in - cutting: 900 mm/min = 15 mm/s)
#<t4_plunge>=180 (T4 60 deg V-bit 1/2in - plunging: 180 mm/min = 3 mm/s)
#<t5_feed>=600 (T5 6mm drill 118 deg - cutting: 600 mm/min = 10 mm/s)
#<t5_plunge>=120 (T5 6mm drill 118 deg - plunging: 120 mm/min = 2 mm/s)
#<t6_feed>=900 (T6 90 deg chamfer 1/2in - cutting: 900 mm/min = 15 mm/s)
#<t6_plunge>=180 (T6 90 deg chamfer 1/2in - plunging: 180 mm/min = 3 mm/s)
#<t7_feed>=720 (T7 tapered ball nose R0.5 10 deg - cutting: 720 mm/min = 12 mm/s)
#<t7_plunge>=120 (T7 tapered ball nose R0.5 10 deg - plunging: 120 mm/min = 2 mm/s)
(Heights above the board top, mm)
#<clear_z>=4 (rapids between regions)
#<safe_z>=2 (feed moves start from here)
(Touch plate)
#<plate>=0.5 (plate thickness, mm)
#<probe_feed>=200 (200 mm/min = 3.33 mm/s)
#<probe_depth>=110 (probe goes down to Z-110 at most, below the work zero)
#<probe_clear>=10 (Z after probing)
#<probe_x>=5 (probe spot X)
#<probe_y>=5 (probe spot Y)

(Start: Tool T1 1/4in flat end mill in the router, jogged to board front-left corner, just above the board, router off)

